# That block was removed by hand, but regeneration kept restoring it and the
# fix was silently lost each time. Ignoring the file makes the removal durable.
# Only comments in client.go are spec-dependent, and the generator version is
# pinned in .github/workflows/generate.yml, so nothing of substance is frozen.
